        "descriptions": [
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "value": "A security flaw has been discovered in Furion .NET Framework up to 4.9.9.95. This affects the function RunCompile of the file framework/Furion/ViewEngine/Engines/ViewEngine.cs of the component View Engine. The manipulation of the argument content results in improper neutralization of special elements used in a template engine. The attack can be executed remotely. The exploit has been released to the public and may be used for attacks. The vendor was contacted early about this disclosure but did not respond in any way."
          }
        ],
